title: "Geomagnetic Activity and Aurora Potential - October 2026"

authors:
  - family-names: "MOHAMED KASIM"
    given-names: "MOHAMED AYAS"
    affiliation: "Universidad Autónoma de Nuevo León"

abstract: >-
  A reproducible scientific computing project analyzing
  geomagnetic activity during October 2026 using planetary
  Kp index observations from the GFZ Helmholtz Centre for
  Geosciences. The project integrates scientific API data
  acquisition, Python-based processing, Parquet data storage,
  and Power BI visualization and validation.

repository-code: "https://github.com/mohamedayas16/Semester_2_CS_2026"

